==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|vrüestücke}} (14th c.). Equivalent to {{compound|de|früh|gloss1=early|Stück|gloss2=piece”, here in the sense of “bite}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈfʁyːʃtʏk/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Frühstück.ogg|audio (Germany)}}
* {{audio|de|De-at-Frühstück.ogg|audio (Austria)}}

